  "prototypeNotes": [
    "The thirty Ability identities and their categories are supplied by the catalog rather than duplicated as hardcoded fields.",
    "All ratings begin at 0.",
    "The 13 / 9 / 5 category allocation applies during CreationBaseAllocation.",
    "No Ability may exceed 3 during base allocation, while later creation spending may reach 5 subject to Rule Set validation.",
    "Untrained policies are category-driven and must be represented in the Dice plan rather than applied by the Narrator silently.",
    "Lupus restrictions are enforced only for base allocation until the freebie exception is resolved.",
    "Chronicle Core remains unaware of Talents, Skills, Knowledges, and all individual Ability identities."
  ]
